WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.049
Was British rule good for

2
00:00:02.049 --> 00:00:03.398
India's economy?

3
00:00:03.398 --> 00:00:05.299
Dadabhai Naoroji added up the

4
00:00:05.299 --> 00:00:06.356
numbers.

5
00:00:06.696 --> 00:00:09.189
His Poverty and Un-British Rule

6
00:00:09.189 --> 00:00:11.310
in India was published in

7
00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:13.218
1901. It argued that wealth

8
00:00:13.218 --> 00:00:15.306
was being drained to Britain.

9
00:00:15.639 --> 00:00:17.281
Home charges: salaries,

10
00:00:17.281 --> 00:00:19.153
pensions and interest paid in

11
00:00:19.153 --> 00:00:21.174
London. And exports that brought

12
00:00:21.174 --> 00:00:22.903
nothing back in return.

13
00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:24.764
Add deindustrialisation,

14
00:00:24.764 --> 00:00:27.028
which ruined handloom weavers,

15
00:00:27.028 --> 00:00:28.333
and commercial farming,

16
00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:29.842
linked to famines.

17
00:00:30.175 --> 00:00:31.352
Your turn.

18
00:00:31.352 --> 00:00:32.804
Who wrote it?
